@page "/denied"
@attribute [AllowAnonymous]

<PageTitle>Not for you · Mootify</PageTitle>

@*  Where authorization failures land. Previously this was the login page, which is wrong
    twice over: it implies signing in again would help when it wouldn't, and rendering the
    login form for somebody who is already signed in mints an antiforgery token bound to
    their identity — so the next post fails with a 400 instead of a message.  *@

<div class="emptystate emptystate--large">
    <img src="img/pietjecow.png" alt="" />
    <h2>That part's not yours</h2>
    <p>You're signed in, but this page needs an admin account.</p>
    <a class="button" href="/">Back to the music</a>
</div>
